<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 13/16.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 13/16.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Monday, June 16 on Friday. The</p>
<p>litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   16.06.97	  13.06.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5176	    6.5276</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3145	    2.3194</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5154	    4.5182</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4993	    3.4965</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5140	    0.5143</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7707	    0.7728</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2900	    0.2899</p>
<p>    LAT	  7.0096	    7.0016</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6944	    0.6940	    </p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2353	    1.2367</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
